WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:19.327
The next morning Sara had a long talk with her doll, Emily, about her father.

2
00:00:19.328 --> 00:00:23.621
"Papa is traveling on the sea now," said Sara.

3
00:00:23.622 --> 00:00:29.025
Emily said nothing, but Sara was sure the doll was listening.

4
00:00:29.026 --> 00:00:34.531
"I believe that dolls have secrets," Sara told her maid, Mariette.

5
00:00:34.532 --> 00:00:38.249
"Perhaps Emily can read and walk and talk.

6
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.515
But she only does those things when no one is watching her."

7
00:00:42.516 --> 00:00:47.170
Mariette smiled at Sara. "It's time for school."

8
00:00:47.171 --> 00:00:51.456
"Just a minute, please," Sara replied.

9
00:00:51.457 --> 00:00:54.558
She went to Emily and gave her a book.

10
00:00:54.559 --> 00:00:59.991
"You can read this while I'm in class," she said to the doll.

11
00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:05.741
"What an odd child!" Mariette thought as she and Sara went downstairs.

12
00:01:05.742 --> 00:01:10.190
But Mariette knew she would like her new job as Sara's maid.

13
00:01:10.191 --> 00:01:15.328
Sara was very kind and polite and had charming manners.

14
00:01:15.329 --> 00:01:20.236
"She's almost like a little princess," thought the maid.

15
00:01:20.237 --> 00:01:25.149
By the time Sara entered the classroom, everyone was talking about her.

16
00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:32.217
"She has so many fancy clothes!" Lavinia Herbert whispered to her best friend, Jessie.

17
00:01:32.218 --> 00:01:33.957
"I passed her room last night.

18
00:01:33.958 --> 00:01:37.128
Her maid was opening a suitcase full of lace petticoats!

19
00:01:37.129 --> 00:01:42.215
She's wearing one now. I saw it when she sat down."

20
00:01:42.216 --> 00:01:47.182
Lavinia was nearly 13 and thought of herself as almost grown up.

21
00:01:47.183 --> 00:01:53.579
"I heard Miss Minchin say it's absolutely ridiculous for a child to have such fancy clothes," she said.

22
00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.058
"I agree with her.

23
00:01:55.059 --> 00:02:01.451
My mother says that children should always dress simply."

24
00:02:01.452 --> 00:02:05.185
The two girls pretended to read their geography books.

25
00:02:05.186 --> 00:02:08.568
But they were really sneaking looks at Sara.

26
00:02:08.569 --> 00:02:16.225
"She's wearing silk stockings!" whispered Jessie. "What tiny feet she has!"

27
00:02:16.226 --> 00:02:20.013
"I don't think she's pretty at all." Lavinia sniffed.

28
00:02:20.014 --> 00:02:24.158
"Her eyes are such a strange color."

29
00:02:24.159 --> 00:02:29.164
"But there's something about her that makes you keep looking at her," said Jessie.

30
00:02:29.165 --> 00:02:34.936
"Her eyelashes are so dark and long, and her eyes are almost green."

31
00:02:34.937 --> 00:02:41.070
Meanwhile Sara sat quietly watching the other girls, who were still staring at her.

32
00:02:41.071 --> 00:02:44.260
"Young ladies," said Miss Minchin.

33
00:02:44.261 --> 00:02:50.451
"I'd like to introduce you to your new classmate, Miss Sara Crewe."

34
00:02:50.452 --> 00:02:54.048
All the girls stood up, and Sara did too.

35
00:02:54.049 --> 00:02:57.009
"I expect you to be nice to Miss Crewe.

36
00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:59.913
She's just come to London from India.

37
00:02:59.914 --> 00:03:05.686
After lessons are over, you will have time to get acquainted with Sara."

38
00:03:05.687 --> 00:03:09.750
The girls bowed to Sara, who curtsied in reply.

39
00:03:09.751 --> 00:03:14.964
"Come here, Sara," said Miss Minchin as the other girls sat down.

40
00:03:14.965 --> 00:03:18.545
Sara obediently went to Miss Minchin's side.

41
00:03:18.546 --> 00:03:23.861
"Your father hired a French maid for you," said the headmistress.

42
00:03:23.862 --> 00:03:27.724
"He must want you to learn French."

43
00:03:27.725 --> 00:03:30.366
Sara felt a little awkward.

44
00:03:30.367 --> 00:03:35.645
"I think he just thought that I'd like Mariette," she replied politely.

45
00:03:35.646 --> 00:03:39.694
Miss Minchin frowned. "You sound very spoiled.

46
00:03:39.695 --> 00:03:43.066
People don't always do things just to make you happy, Sara.

47
00:03:43.067 --> 00:03:47.266
Your father clearly wants you to learn French."

48
00:03:47.267 --> 00:03:53.126
Sara flushed, unsure of what to say. Her mother had been French.

49
00:03:53.127 --> 00:03:57.909
Her father had loved her mother and had often spoken French to Sara.

50
00:03:57.910 --> 00:04:00.893
But Miss Minchin looked so mean.

51
00:04:00.894 --> 00:04:04.146
Sara didn't know how to explain things to her.

52
00:04:04.147 --> 00:04:09.057
"I've never actually studied French," Sara began, "but—"

53
00:04:09.058 --> 00:04:15.884
"Well, then it's time you started to study it," the headmistress said impatiently.

54
00:04:15.885 --> 00:04:19.402
Miss Minchin herself had never learned to speak French.

55
00:04:19.403 --> 00:04:24.627
But this was an embarrassing secret that she didn't intend to share with anyone.

56
00:04:24.628 --> 00:04:30.022
"Here's our French teacher now," she added sharply.

57
00:04:30.023 --> 00:04:33.076
"Everyone, take out your French books."

58
00:04:33.077 --> 00:04:37.257
Monsieur Dufarge looked like a nice, intelligent man.

59
00:04:37.258 --> 00:04:43.537
When he saw Sara he smiled. "Is this a new pupil for me, Madame?" he asked.

60
00:04:43.538 --> 00:04:49.104
"Her father—Captain Crewe—is very eager for her to learn the language.

61
00:04:49.105 --> 00:04:56.591
But I'm afraid that Sara seems less eager to learn," Miss Minchin replied with a frown.

62
00:04:56.592 --> 00:05:00.725
Sara rose in her seat, suddenly feeling a bit desperate.

63
00:05:00.726 --> 00:05:05.764
She felt sure that she could explain her situation to Monsieur Dufarge.

64
00:05:05.765 --> 00:05:11.057
And she did exactly that, speaking to him in perfect French.

65
00:05:11.058 --> 00:05:16.383
Miss Minchin started quite violently, and then she glared at Sara.

66
00:05:16.384 --> 00:05:22.674
But Monsieur Dufarge was already charmed by the girl who spoke his language so beautifully.

67
00:05:22.675 --> 00:05:27.667
"Ah, Miss Minchin," he said. "There isn't much I can teach Sara.

68
00:05:27.668 --> 00:05:32.051
She hasn't studied French. She is French."

69
00:05:32.052 --> 00:05:35.447
Miss Minchin's cheeks flushed.

70
00:05:35.448 --> 00:05:40.086
"You should have told me!" the headmistress snapped at Sara.

71
00:05:40.087 --> 00:05:46.978
"I—I tried," said Sara. "I guess I should have tried harder."

72
00:05:46.979 --> 00:05:53.097
Lavinia and Jessie giggled from behind their French books.

73
00:05:53.098 --> 00:05:57.061
Sara had made the headmistress look a bit foolish.

74
00:05:57.062 --> 00:06:01.316
"Silence, young ladies!" Miss Minchin rapped on her desk.

75
00:06:01.317 --> 00:06:10.045
"Silence!" And from that moment on, she began to dislike her new student.
